clean, zero warnings.\n- **Direct-link harness**, 6 entry-point modes: all byte-identical, matching exit codes.\n- **Adversarial suite** (891 bytes): `%d`/`%s`/`%n`/`%p` format strings passed as data, empty string, tabs, 599-byte string, `INT_MAX`/`INT_MIN`/negative/`0x100` truthiness, repeated calls, and `printf`/`fputs` **interleaving** to expose any stream-buffering mismatch → identical MD5 `b97c661d…`.\n- **`dlopen`/`dlsym` path**: all 4 symbols resolve, output byte-identical.\n- The Rust `.so` drop-in satisfies every C call site at link time.\n- `c_src/` unmodified.\n\nDeliverables are `Cargo.toml` (`crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`), `src/lib.rs`, and `src/driver.rs` in the current directory. The extra `U` undefined symbols in the Rust `.so` are just Rust-runtime imports, not exports, so the ABI surface matches exactly."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1499,"cache_read_input_tokens":36503,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1499,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f1343e3-1e87-4c12-9d54-4e1c1adf10a0","uuid":"628eceed-e8e7-49d4-a4c6-9e19e6e14c5a","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:27:08.798Z"}
